{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01725","headline":"杂曲歌辞 侠客行 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 侠客行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赵客缦胡缨，吴钩霜雪明。\n银鞍照白马，飒沓如流星。\n十步杀一人，千里不留行。\n事了拂衣去，深藏身与名。\n闲过信陵饮，脱劒膝前横。\n将炙啖朱亥，持觞劝侯嬴。\n三杯吐然诺，五岳倒爲轻。\n眼花耳热後，意气素霓生。\n救赵挥金槌，邯郸先震惊。\n千秋二壮士，烜赫大梁城。\n纵死侠骨香，不慙世上英。\n谁能书阁下，白首太玄经。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}